  "text": "Recipe: Soybean Pancakes\nCreator: Frank Lee\nCategory: Pancakes\nIngredients: soybean, water, whole meal flour, spring onion, black salt, blueberries, strawberries\nCooking methods: soak, blend, cook\nInstructions: BATTER: Soak 1 cup soybean overnight. Blend soaked beans in 3/4 cup of water. Mix with 1 cup of whole meal flour. Add chopped spring onion and pinch of black salt. PANCAKES: Cook over non-stick pan for 3 mins each side on medium heat. Pancakes will be crispy outside & soft inside.\nNotes: A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (whole meal flour), BEANS (soybean), RAINBOW VEGGIES (spring onion), BERRIES (blueberries, strawberries). Shared in FaceBook Group: \"SANE (Sleep, Attitude, Nutrition, Exercise) for Life\"",
